Saturated fat are also use a big poportion in dinner, with 37%. However, compared to sodium in dinner using, there is still some distance between that. Saturated fat has also used 21% and 26% on lunch and snacks.

Added sugar are 42% used in snacks. The persentages for the breakfast for both saturated fat and added sugar are the same, that is 16%. For dinner and lunch, added sugar resulted in last place.

